[9.392233, "o", "cat /app/vatnotes/BAYMAP.txt && printf '\\n--- forms ---\\n' && cat /app/vatnotes/forms.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[9.394027, "o", "millcue   argv and hull\r\nhopbag    well bag\r\nobjbay    object pick\r\nribvat    provenance writer\r\nsidelog   contact log\r\ncardurn   cards\r\ndbgwells  debug objects\r\ndumpit    dumps\r\nvatnotes  this map\r\n"]
[9.394406, "o", "\r\n--- forms ---\r\n"]
[9.396827, "o", "backtrace.txt\r\nEach line is NAME at 0xHHHHHHHH\r\nHex is eight lowercase digits.\r\nWhen a source row exists, the line continues with a space and FILE:LINE.\r\n\r\nprovenance.json\r\n{\r\n  \"objects\": [\r\n    {\"build_id\": \"<id>\", \"host\": \"<well directory name>\"}\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\nobjects are sorted by build_id ascending.\r\n\r\nok.mark\r\nThe bytes o k newline.\r\n\r\n/app/dumpit/shift.core names aabbccdd and eeff0011.\r\nWell directory names under /app/dbgwells: deepwell, fastpit, midquay.\r\nExample splice: /app/bin/ashquay splice /app/dumpit/shift.core /app/outkeg/runA\r\n\r\n"]
[9.397222, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[9.397373, "o", "root@becc3f9ef121:/app# "]
[9.58258, "i", "printf '\\n--- tree ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort\n"]
[9.583407, "o", "printf '\\n--- tree ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n--- tree ---\r\n"]
[9.586145, "o", "/app/bin/ashquay\r\n/app/cardurn/deepwell.card\r\n/app/cardurn/fastpit.card\r\n/app/cardurn/midquay.card\r\n/app/dbgwells/deepwell/aabbccdd.dbg\r\n/app/dbgwells/deepwell/eeff0011.dbg\r\n/app/dbgwells/fastpit/aabbccdd.dbg\r\n/app/dbgwells/fastpit/eeff0011.dbg\r\n/app/dbgwells/midquay/99887766.dbg\r\n/app/dbgwells/midquay/aabbccdd.dbg\r\n/app/dumpit/shift.core\r\n/app/hopbag/op_bag.c\r\n/app/hopbag/op_bag.h\r\n"]
